Thank you for your feedback and attention! ːwinterbunny2023ː
[b]Here are the bug fixes included in the first FlopHop Demo update:[/b]

- Fixed the problem with jumping during dialogues in the intro quest;
- Added a control hint in the top-right corner until full control customization is introduced :)
- Prevented players from exiting quest dialogues by clicking on other items at the station;
- Resolved the looping issue with the soundtrack in the cave;
- Fixed several minor UI bugs.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45046878/279a91bb66999a68856cc501a429812bf3b7a7b4.jpg[/img]

Thanks for playing [url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/3134890/Bunny_Space_Odyssey_FlopHop_Demo/?beta=1]Bunny Space Odyssey: FlopHop Demo[/url]! Excited to keep improving the game and making it more enjoyable and smooth!
